<b>Linguistically Aware Coreference Evaluation Tool</b>
<BR/>
<BR/>
As all the commonly-used evaluation metrics for entity coreference resolution are linguistically agnostic, treating
the mentions to be clustered as generic rather than linguistic objects. We propose a framework for incorporating
linguistic awareness into commonly-used coreference evaluation metrics.
<BR/>
<BR/>
We implemented the Linguistically-Aware version for <i>MUC</i>, <i>B<sup><i>3</i></sup></i> and <i>CEAF</i>.
Click here for the
<a href="scorer.tar">code</a>.

